<title>FRANCE: GEC Alsthom wins Indonesian power contract.</title>
<headline>GEC Alsthom wins Indonesian power contract.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>GEC Alsthom said on Wednesday its European Gas Turbines unit had won a turnkey contract to deliver a combined power and heat station to Asia Pulp and Paper at its Indah Kiat plant near Tangerang, Indonesia. No financial details were disclosed.</p>
<p>EGT will supply two Typhoon 4.9 MegaWatt gas turbines and related equipment and the group will also be responsible for running the unit. The power plant will be put into service at the end of the year, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
